VERDICT: PASS -- the authored expected result of AWP-4357 is met in full on real
hardware, and beneath it the ARP exchange the ping only implies was measured on the
wire: the DUT answers, with its own MAC, for an address on the very interface the
request arrived on, and does not answer for an address it cannot route or for one
outside that interface's own subnet.
