  The authored expected result, point by point:
    "Expect ping to fail"              -> 3 transmitted, 0 received, 100% packet loss. MET.
    "but with ARP using DUT MAC addr"  -> BackupSW broadcast who-has 23.1.1.3, one
                                          request from 00:00:cd:42:30:29, visible in the
                                          capture, and was answered by the DUT. MET.
    "DUT MAC address will be saved on  -> BackupSW's ARP table holds 23.1.1.3 ->
